{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1a56f924f5030c9f015928c4d1b462d8a119993d7d1ee8c0b32746959bb2af4d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_497f4b800c8e2214a6b962f4e75fde6b5206778ae673c3b4394ea68911cde368","slc_a0200af8dc8019ae772bee4d8f98788c92b09f20392013cb2217348da650206d","slc_c2a15b92aeb8bf7be64f6e39fc5ea7e42b43b1985c2724d8ca4eea6bd2fe394a"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The agent communicates with the Android device through Android Debug Bridge (adb) from a PC, with USB debugging enabled on the device; an Android Studio emulator is also supported and auto-detected.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2d201c7f6b500375e234eeb825d3be5cd8fca958b61e5144e3414bb6478bbc3d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_08eab392b51ac4b423ff2c18dab2539caced401ecc905425d86062023c9ba013","slc_287b0987b4f98c4a2aa602ef317c5a31e86b18fafd00ac5d170e2c9ff04b7235"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The README links to an evaluation benchmark (testset.md) that was released in January 2024 and used during the team's testing of AppAgent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ea065a1e416ed0da84c1ba7b3be598e14bd560daa6cf7d83eeff152edc802d0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0aa70760fd19f43d9db321e8ca961e29635282268b8cba668697ca9ab46e139c","slc_73f3b0859891b7abfab44f38a4ab264f19fd007a311806f64482db631e4e3e05","slc_d0c6f6e4303ce523b952f2b36ad3343373d2fc3df2508d2da7e427b8504de167"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The agent is powered by a multimodal model such as GPT-4V (gpt-4-vision-preview) or the alternative qwen-vl-max, configured via config.yaml with an API key and request interval.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4f4d961868003efe652726f09c98a7d9555b6d94508e80e18523074c6e4bf423","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_691ec4c521853d92539c7939cf10e3cc06d0a3309fcf9248c08e623c370dec21","slc_a706d815d5feca7ee7ae860810ab74d8cdb7300da11d9406217ab44d7d4a842c"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"During exploration or demonstration, the agent generates documentation for interacted UI elements and saves it for use in the deployment phase; deployment can auto-detect an existing documentation base for an app.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_60af8cd4579a340bfacf3cf6b182f6046a72708daaf82f27d5a31e940a40067b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b645a7dea160124ad93f6675fb8cd81dd0f1e254d603ed1a241a39a21a45fbec"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The agent learns to use new apps either by autonomous exploration or by observing human demonstrations, producing a knowledge base it later consults for complex tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_616a7f39b408dbe9499745569b5e7aa77f9f077ae99045f382427ed015115c08","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6bb116b2d8dd0fb202fcbf38d82c2baeb25c94658229799d2d2a710fa826e0b4"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The agent acts through a simplified action space mimicking human interactions like tapping and swiping, avoiding the need for system back-end access so it works across diverse apps.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_98612d7fe81ad42500dd03c68479f5d61780664736b189c2c90231412b154135","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1cc86afdb2c57c56fbe5c4b3a856efeb3cb82dd71f8a4b190ca560942ecf7947"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"AppAgent is described as a novel LLM-based multimodal agent framework designed to operate smartphone applications.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cde3da9aeef81b3504198ca0c1712a41655e78a32c15975afdaf4f23ff8e86aa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_691ec4c521853d92539c7939cf10e3cc06d0a3309fcf9248c08e623c370dec21"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"In deployment, if no documentation base exists for an app, the agent can run without documentation but success rate is not guaranteed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e3423a2dc4b68357bbb647fb9a04996bec4ca654ed5da0e07b3ee1b2607f2f30","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12dec496ac0b0e5a574012db351cb24c18f62fc891666d40029663e83124122e","slc_691ec4c521853d92539c7939cf10e3cc06d0a3309fcf9248c08e623c370dec21","slc_b512f67fad8a0a80367876e9a1d75bc3cbfa5d78248cfea0c97a8c967e06a881"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"Users run `learn.py` to enter autonomous exploration or human demonstration mode, and `run.py` for deployment, supplying app name and task description via prompts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ea4c4365622c3628ce30c5701e52cfe9cea5fade4c24db0fa0f98015883594c2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"tencentqqgylab/appagent@2c1900422caf snapshot cbf24173f142265b","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_60c64c07f2e0d7ab3872e1b7d2188b9553f64481cd6a58331a893fcd74fc4f3f","slc_73f3b0859891b7abfab44f38a4ab264f19fd007a311806f64482db631e4e3e05"],"source_ids":["src_b7664c10e2975bd2b0ce399eacab1d46"],"text":"The qwen-vl-max alternative model is free but reportedly performs poorer than GPT-4V in the AppAgent context, and each GPT-4V request/response pair costs around $0.03.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b840705b3e9142eda4e95f2ca4dd7f19"}
